CONTEXT Keywords IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Keywords
{+ The word AS is recognised after the file name of an INCLUDE statement only.
Elsewhere it remains an ordinary identifier, so scripts that use it keep compiling. +}

INCLUDE "../contexts/registry.adl" AS AS

CONCEPT AS "An autonomous system on the internet."
RELATION peers[AS*AS] [SYM]
RELATION operator[AS*AS.Person] [UNI]
POPULATION peers[AS*AS] CONTAINS [ ("AS1103", "AS3333") ; ("AS3333", "AS1103") ]
POPULATION operator[AS*AS.Person] CONTAINS [ ("AS1103", "p1") ]

ENDCONTEXT
